_refine_special_details
;
The body-centred tetragonal cell was refined from the powder line positions
with a = 14.39278 A and c = 7.74129 A. The 00l extinction is consistent with
the 41 screw axis. Atomic coordinates are the best chemistry-constrained
direct-space solution retained after rejecting lower-residual models with
unphysical cation-cation or anion-anion contacts.
